; `load` is not allowed inside a proof block, like `use`: `assume A` / `load helper` (with `use B`)
; used to give `A implies B` (soundness review of 2026-09-29, §8.17)
; (in a helper file: inside `expect`, whose content is discarded, `load` is allowed)
expect "EvalError" "`load` is not allowed inside `assume`"
    load "helpers/load-in-assume.kurt"
